# A list of kernel modules (or their aliases) to be included
# in the generated image. Depencies are automatically discovered and included
# also. modules.dep is also automatically generatesd.
# 
# e.g: Uncommenting the line below would include usb_f_ffs.ko.xz and
# libcomposite.ko.xz:
#
dwc2
ipv6
# Exposes the bootloader config (the blconfig alias) as an nvmem device, so
# Imager can read IMAGER_REPO_URL. A module, not built in, in the rpi-v8 kernel.
nvmem-rmem
